14.	Number of participants trained on green chemistry in plastic manufacturing
15.	Annual reduction of the targeted companies&#x2019; material flows (e.g., consumption of chemicals, raw materials, energy and/or waste streams)
16. /
17.	Incentive mechanism to ensure sustainability and replicability of green chemistry initiative in the manufacturing industry developed
18.   A complete Remediation designs for, at least, two (2) POPs contaminated sites will be drafted
19.  Documentation of project results and achievements
20. Methodology for POPs monitoring and evaluation of results developed
21. Study visits to the institutions from the region for showcasing the best practices of POPs M&amp;E to the relevant institutions organized
22</narrative>
